---
import aboutImage from "../assets/About.svg";
import aboutSide from "../assets/about-image.png";
---

<h2>ABOUT</h2>
<div class="p-5 transform about-text-content">
    <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-lg mt-8 md:mt-0 mb-6">
        <img
            class="w-full mb-4 md:w-2/5 md:float-left md:mr-6"
            src={aboutSide.src}
            alt="Abstract background"
        />
        <span
            class="float-left text-red-500 text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold leading-none mr-2"
            >G</span
        >reetings! I am a Computer Science Graduate from UTSA with
        concentrations in Software Engineering and Data Science. While my
        day-to-day involves resolving technical puzzles as an IT Help Desk
        Technician at University Health, I’ve been fascinated by technology and
        the web from the moment I used my first computer.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-lg mb-6">
        I am fluent in technologies like React, TypeScript, and Node.js, and I
        enjoy mastering new tools to build high-performance, accessible
        applications. You’ll notice my work often leans into a 90s analog
        aesthetic—a style inspired by childhood memories of neon lights, VHS
        movies, and the liminal atmosphere of 90s retail spaces.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-lg">
        When I’m not creating new experiences, you can find me creating art,
        playing video games, and watching horror movies. All of these fuel the
        creativity and nostalgic energy I bring to my code and design.
    </p>
</div>
